{
  "uid": "ai-token-offload",
  "title": "AI Token Offload",
  "description": "Daily UTC observed token workload across Claude Code, Codex and ZCode, with dispatcher completion counts, token reporting coverage and a fixed pre-offload snapshot. Token workload is not billed cost or a causal estimate of savings.",
  "tags": [
    "ai-observability",
    "offload"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d/d",
    "to": "now/d"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading the daily totals",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Each bar ends at 00:00 UTC and covers the preceding calendar day. The default range excludes the current partial day; keep UTC midnight boundaries when changing the range. Claude includes input, output, cache creation and cache read tokens. Codex uses only `token_type=\"total\"`; cached and reasoning tokens are subsets. ZCode jobs count completed runs, including continuations, by completion time. Reported tokens cover only runs that return a complete native token total; missing usage is unknown. Offload share is the observed ZCode token fraction, not monetary savings or a causal comparison. Check reporting coverage before comparing days."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Daily Claude and Codex tokens",
      "description": "Counters summed across all reporting sessions. Claude's four mutually exclusive token types are included; Codex's total already includes its cached and reasoning subsets. Missing telemetry remains unknown.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 10000,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(increase(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total[1d]))",
          "legendFormat": "Claude Code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1d",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(increase(codex_turn_token_usage_sum{token_type=\"total\"}[1d]))",
          "legendFormat": "Codex",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1d",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "barAlignment": -1,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Daily ZCode jobs",
      "description": "Completed dispatcher runs by outcome. Continuations each count once; a run is attributed to its UTC completion day.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 10000,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (max_over_time(agent_dispatch_runs{tool=\"zcode\"}[1d] offset 1ms))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1d",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "barAlignment": -1,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Daily reported ZCode tokens",
      "description": "Sum of complete native token totals reported by ZCode. This is a partial total when coverage is below 100%; no reported totals produces No data, not zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 10000,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(agent_dispatch_tokens{tool=\"zcode\",token_type=\"total\"}[1d] offset 1ms))",
          "legendFormat": "Reported ZCode tokens",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1d",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "barAlignment": -1,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Daily observed offload share",
      "description": "Reported ZCode tokens / (Claude + Codex + reported ZCode tokens). A workload share, not a cost or savings estimate. Unreported ZCode usage is excluded; coverage below 100% understates ZCode's contribution. Missing agent telemetry or no reported ZCode usage leaves the share unknown.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 10000,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(agent_dispatch_tokens{tool=\"zcode\",token_type=\"total\"}[1d] offset 1ms)) / (sum(increase(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total[1d])) + sum(increase(codex_turn_token_usage_sum{token_type=\"total\"}[1d])) + sum(max_over_time(agent_dispatch_tokens{tool=\"zcode\",token_type=\"total\"}[1d] offset 1ms)))",
          "legendFormat": "Reported ZCode share",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1d",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "barAlignment": -1,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Daily ZCode token reporting coverage",
      "description": "Runs with a complete native total / all completed ZCode runs. Zero is shown only when runs exist but none report tokens. No completed runs produces No data.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 10000,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(count(max_over_time(agent_dispatch_tokens{tool=\"zcode\",token_type=\"total\"}[1d] offset 1ms)) or on() (0 * sum(max_over_time(agent_dispatch_runs{tool=\"zcode\"}[1d] offset 1ms)))) / sum(max_over_time(agent_dispatch_runs{tool=\"zcode\"}[1d] offset 1ms))",
          "legendFormat": "Runs reporting tokens",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1d",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "barAlignment": -1,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Daily ZCode jobs by repository",
      "description": "Completed dispatcher runs per repository and outcome. Job and run identify individual events; the dashboard groups them for daily reporting.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 10000,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (repo, outcome) (max_over_time(agent_dispatch_runs{tool=\"zcode\"}[1d] offset 1ms))",
          "legendFormat": "{{repo}} / {{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1d",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "barAlignment": -1,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Daily ZCode run duration",
      "description": "Mean elapsed seconds per completed run by outcome; each continuation is a separate run.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 10000,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (max_over_time(agent_dispatch_duration_seconds{tool=\"zcode\"}[1d] offset 1ms)) / sum by (outcome) (max_over_time(agent_dispatch_runs{tool=\"zcode\"}[1d] offset 1ms))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1d",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "barAlignment": -1,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pre-offload snapshot: 2026-10-03 UTC (partial day)",
      "description": "Frozen snapshot: 2026-10-03 00:00:00 through 20:06:04 UTC (72,364 seconds; 20h 06m 04s). Captured with sum(increase(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total[72364s])) and sum(increase(codex_turn_token_usage_sum{token_type=\"total\"}[72364s])) evaluated at time=1791057964. Claude telemetry covered the laptop only; Codex includes some unattributed series. No ZCode series were observed at capture. This is an observed partial-day baseline, not a full-day or both-device total; compare only matching duration and telemetry coverage.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(last_over_time(ai_offload_baseline_tokens{harness=\"claude\",day=\"2026-10-03\"}[730d] @ 1791057965))",
          "legendFormat": "Claude Code baseline",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(last_over_time(ai_offload_baseline_tokens{harness=\"codex\",day=\"2026-10-03\"}[730d] @ 1791057965))",
          "legendFormat": "Codex baseline",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    }
  ]
}
